        "title": "03 - Trigonometry: The Full Refresh",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "UNIT CIRCLE:\n  ┌──────────────────┐\n  │      (0,1)       │\n  │        │         │\n  │  (-1,0)┼──(1,0)  │\n  │        │         │\n  │      (0,-1)      │\n  └──────────────────┘\n    P = (cos θ, sin θ) for any angle θ.\n    UNIT CIRCLE IS THE MASTER DEFINITION."
    },
