      "text": "COMPLEX PLANE:\n  ┌──────────────────────┐\n  │ e^(iθ) = cos + i·sin │\n  │                      │\n  │ e^(iπ) + 1 = 0       │\n  │ (Euler's formula =   │\n  │  everything)         │\n  └──────────────────────┘\n    z = r·e^(iθ)"
